<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="git-addon-exclude-files-from-version-control">
    <title>Exclude files from version control</title>
    <shortdesc>Exclude untracked files and folders from Git version control by adding them to a
    project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> or the global <codeph>ignore</codeph> file. </shortdesc>
    <conbody>
    <p>Each line in an ignore file specifies a pattern, for example a file path or extension. Git
      uses these patterns to determine which files to exclude from version control.</p>
    <p>Git uses <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> files for repository-level version control and the
        <codeph>ignore</codeph> file for user-level version control. Each repository has its own
        <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> file, while each user has their own <codeph>.ignore</codeph>
      file. </p>
    <p>To exclude a pattern from project-level version control, add it to the
        <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> file of the repository associated with that project. To exclude
      a file from version control across all projects, add it to the <codeph>ignore</codeph> file.  </p>
        <p>Once you add a path or pattern to either ignore file, the associated untracked file or
      folder no longer appears on <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> > <uicontrol>Unstaged
        Files</uicontrol>. To re-enable change tracking, remove the path or pattern from the
      relevant ignore file.</p>
        <note id="note_kpd_g5d_mjc">Once a file or folder becomes tracked, you can no longer exclude
      it from Git version control by adding it to an ignore file.</note>
    <section id="git-addon-add-files-to-project-gitignore-automatically">
      <title>Add patterns to project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> automatically</title>
      <p>To access the automatic ignore actions, follow these steps:<ol id="ol_vjg_nkn_njc">
          <li>On <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/> &gt;
              <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>, select
            the files and folders you want to exclude from project version control.</li>
          <li>Right-click anywhere on <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/> to open
            the context menu. </li>
          <li>In the context menu, select <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>.<ol
              id="ol_uwm_cln_njc">
              <li>If you select multiple items, the Git Client adds them to the project
                  <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</li>
              <li>If you select a file or folder, choose an action from the <uicontrol
                  conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/> submenu. Your
                available actions depend on whether you select a file or folder.<p>
                  <table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_gbw_2nn_njc">
                    <title>Actions that ignore files</title>
                    <tgroup cols="3">
                      <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="3" colname="newCol3" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <thead>
                        <row>
                          <entry>Action</entry>
                          <entry>To access</entry>
                          <entry>Excludes</entry>
                        </row>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-file"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>The selected file</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-by-extension"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>Files with the same extension as the selected file</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-1-ignore-all-files"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a folder</entry>
                          <entry>All files in the selected folder</entry>
                        </row>
                      </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                  </table>
                </p><p>
                  <table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_jdz_fb4_njc">
                    <title>Actions that ignore folders</title>
                    <tgroup cols="3">
                      <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <colspec colnum="3" colname="newCol3" colwidth="1*"/>
                      <thead>
                        <row>
                          <entry>Action</entry>
                          <entry>To access</entry>
                          <entry>Excludes</entry>
                        </row>
                      </thead>
                      <tbody>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-0-ignore-dir"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a folder</entry>
                          <entry>The selected folder and its contents</entry>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                          <entry><uicontrol
                              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore-parent-dir"
                            /></entry>
                          <entry>Select a file</entry>
                          <entry>The selected file's parent folder and its contents</entry>
                        </row>
                      </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                  </table>
                </p></li>
            </ol></li>
        </ol></p>
      <p>The selected file or folder no longer appears on <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/> and its
        pattern is added to the project <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_zcp_1h4_njc">
      <title>Open ignore files</title>
      <p> Use the <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> file to exclude files from repository or project-level
        version control, and the global <codeph>ignore</codeph> file to exclude files from version
        control across all repositories on your machine. </p>
      <p>To open ignore files, first go to the <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/> view.</p>
      <ul id="ul_aw5_s1y_jjc">
        <li>To open ignore files at any time, go to the <xref
            href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"
                ><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png" id="image_cc4_bkg_njc"
              />Ellipsis</uicontrol> menu</xref> and select <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>. From the <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/> submenu, select
            <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-gitignore"/> or
            <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-ignore"/>. </li>
        <li>To open ignore files from an untracked resource, on <uicontrol
            conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>,
          right-click an untracked file or folder to open the contextual menu. <ul
            id="ul_w4c_tlg_njc">
            <li>To open a project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>, select <uicontrol
                conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
              <b>></b>
              <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-gitignore"/>.<p>
                <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjc">
                  <title>Opening the project .gitignore</title>
                  <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/open_proj_gitignore.png"
                    id="image_fbq_vzd_mjc"/>
                </fig>
              </p></li>
            <li>To open the global <codeph>ignore</codeph> file, select <uicontrol
                conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
              <b>></b>
              <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-ignore"/>.
            </li>
          </ul></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    </conbody>
</concept>